</code></pre> <p>If you set any of the following, they will be picked up in this order:</p> <ol> <li><code>FINAL_K</code> in <code>.env</code></li> <li><code>FINAL_K</code> in <code>agro_config.json</code></li> <li><code>LANGGRAPH_FINAL_K</code> in <code>.env</code></li> <li><code>LANGGRAPH_FINAL_K</code> in <code>agro_config.json</code></li> <li>Hardcoded default <code>10</code></li> </ol> <p>You don’t need to know this to use AGRO, but it matters if you’re debugging “why am I still getting 10 results?”</p>

